{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫電視59周年台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》於11月9日首播，馬國明與陳豪在劇中為了陳自瑤上演激烈三角關係。最新劇情揭露 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫電視59周年台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》於11月9日首播，馬國明與陳豪在劇中為了陳自瑤上演激烈三角關係。最新劇情揭露馬國明搶先與女方發生關係，令原本準備求婚的陳豪大受打擊。隨着怒掉求婚戒指一幕播出，這段兄弟爭女風波正式掀起一場殘酷暗戰。</p>\n<h2>陳豪求婚前驚悉馬國明捷足先登</h2>\n<p>在本週播出的《玫瑰戰爭》劇情中，陳豪飾演天誠娛樂老闆陳雲生，原本滿心歡喜準備向影后關子盈求婚，卻意外得知同母異父弟弟李德龍早已搶先一步與女方發生關係。陳雲生大受打擊，由偏遠複式豪宅獨自徒步走到旺角行人天橋，更憤然將求婚戒指掟走。陳雲生在天橋上的落寞身影成為該集焦點所在。</p>\n<h2>監製拆解陳豪馬國明兄弟身份之謎</h2>\n<p>由於陳豪角色名為陳雲生，而馬國明角色名為李德龍，不少觀眾對兩人同母異父兄弟設定感到疑惑。劇集監製對此作出公開解釋，指出兩個名字其實皆為娛樂圈藝名，情況等同於秦沛與姜大衛這對現實中不同姓氏兄弟一樣。監製亦表明這項細節安排是為了突顯劇中人物背景。</p>\n<h2>劇集改編網絡小說結局設定震撼</h2>\n<p>這次劇集改編自吳沚默創作網絡小說《維多利亞的派對》，不過電視版本在人物設定上作出大幅度修改。在原著故事中馬國明角色設定為姚子羚表弟，並且愛上楊茜堯最終更慘遭女方毒手。根據原著第27章結局描述情節走向極度暗黑，陳豪飾演角色因涉及4屍命案被判終身監禁，而楊茜堯角色最後更親手放火燒死馬國明角色，未知劇集最終會否完全跟隨這個震撼結局。</p>\n<h2>觀眾猜測馬國明陳自瑤命運走向</h2>\n<p>隨著錯綜複雜兄弟爭女情節播出，大批觀眾在網上熱烈討論劇情發展。有網民留言表示「陳豪掉戒指嗰幕真係好心酸」，認為他因愛成恨絕對有充分動機對陳自瑤痛下殺手。同時也有觀眾對於劇集改動原著設定感到驚喜，紛紛留下「估唔到馬國明同陳豪係兄弟」、「強強對決真係好有火花」等評論，大眾對於這場牽涉多條人命娛樂圈恩怨情仇抱有極高期待，急不及待想揭開終極謎團。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455376319384178_4018110546af6b7a3c913b.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-7.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455376319384178_4018110546af6b7a3c913b.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪在劇中飾演娛樂公司老闆陳雲生，原本打算向心愛的關子盈求婚，結果卻發現自己早已被親弟弟捷足先登。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455376904916408_10395173336af6b7a96e3ef.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-8.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455376904916408_10395173336af6b7a96e3ef.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪得悉殘酷真相後神情凝重，內心百般滋味在心頭。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455377559011745_11987804096af6b7b067694.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-4.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455377559011745_11987804096af6b7b067694.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>馬國明原來是陳豪的親弟弟，兩人卻同時愛上陳自瑤飾演的關子盈。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455378453376750_17571686126af6b7b9049c2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-2.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455378453376750_17571686126af6b7b9049c2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪在天橋上神情沉重（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455379210849905_16400665476af6b7c1043be.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-6.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455379210849905_16400665476af6b7c1043be.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪早已準備好鑽石戒指（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455380818422568_634161276af6b7d0a166d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-10.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455380818422568_634161276af6b7d0a166d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪最終狠心將求婚戒指掟走（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455381772682212_19397738586af6b7da38e61.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--05-DramasQ-22’41”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455381772682212_19397738586af6b7da38e61.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>馬國明搶先與陳自瑤發展感情（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455382017617403_17798969296af6b7dc99116.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--05-DramasQ-2’40”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455382017617403_17798969296af6b7dc99116.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪原本打算向心愛的關子盈求婚。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%b1%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳豪</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a6%ac%e5%9c%8b%e6%98%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">馬國明</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3541742\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:42:11.717425+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1393,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:36:30.911902+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:42.470481+00:00","content_hash":"4173dc7838b469b36b893c7e998f6120c721181203cb65f8e63445958e88f51f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}